WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.580
Quote settings: quote validity, deposits, VAT, line-item templates and terms templates.

2
00:00:09.128 --> 00:00:14.030
In "Quotes and payment", set the "Default payment plan" and "Deposit %".

3
00:00:14.582 --> 00:00:18.600
Save frequent lines with prices under "Line-item templates".

4
00:00:19.148 --> 00:00:22.070
Write your terms under "Terms templates".

5
00:00:22.617 --> 00:00:29.610
Turn on "Ask for the deposit right after acceptance" so the deposit is requested right after acceptance.

6
00:00:30.161 --> 00:00:35.800
Write the terms carefully once and have them reviewed; they repeat in every quote.
